### ==========================================
### 前置准备：获取认证 Token（如果需要）
### ==========================================
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}




### ==========================================
### 1. 标签相关 API 测试
### ==========================================

### 1.1 获取项目的所有标签 (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
POST http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/1/metadata
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Laboratory animal experiment",
  "category": "animal",
  "tags": ["animal", "experiment"],
  "dataSource": "mysql"
}
### 1.2 添加一个新标签 (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tag": "veterinary"
}


### 1.3 添加重复标签（验证幂等性） (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tag": "animal"
}


### 1.4 添加带连字符的标签 (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tag": "lab-animal"
}


### 1.5 删除指定标签 (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags/animal
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 1.6 删除带连字符的标签 (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags/lab-animal
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ==========================================
### 2. 异常与边界情况测试
### ==========================================

### 2.1 拒绝无效的项目 ID - GET
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/abc/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 2.2 拒绝无效的项目 ID - POST (添加标签)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/abc/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tag": "animal"
}


### 2.3 拒绝无效的项目 ID - DELETE (删除标签)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/abc/metadata/tags/animal
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 2.4 拒绝缺少标签路径参数的请求 (应返回 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 2.5 拒绝空白标签 (应返回 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tag": "   "
}


### 2.6 测试未授权访问 (应返回 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata/tags